sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager
    participant T as Talent - review and calibration
    participant K as Compliance checker
    participant E as Payroll engine
    participant L as Filing ledger

    M->>T: Rating and increment recommendation for the cycle
    Note over M,T: An AI-drafted note needs a named confirmer and a snapshot, FR-T-D005
    T->>T: Calibration moves recorded with actor, before, after and reason
    T->>K: Increment outcome proposed as a compensation assignment with its effective date
    K->>E: Approved, a new B-class compensation assignment row from the effective date
    E->>E: Is the effective date inside a closed period
    alt Effective date inside a closed period
        E->>E: Arrears batch, each past month recomputed on that month's rule versions, FR-PAY-401
        E->>K: Approval artefact shows the PF liability date from the planned disbursal date
        E->>L: Arrears PF carried as blocked pending the arrear-return layout, EV-043
    else Effective date in the open month
        E->>E: Revised structure applies from the effective date in the current run
    end
    E->>M: Increment letter drafted with figures bound to the engine
    Note over E,L: The corrected months' ECRs are not rewritten. A later change of the actual disbursal date re-derives the PF due month
